    "detailed_description": "<h1>224% Funded on Kickstarter \ud83c\udf6a Late Pledge on Ko-fi!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/0ee00e219e35cd1e014a3ef6bad1119e.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Heirloom</i> Kickstarter campaign has been successfully completed!</strong>  For those who missed it but still wish to support the game development, a special opportunity to make a <strong>late pledge is available on Ko-fi</strong>. Don't miss exclusive limited rewards!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/8da91911cdd1655a632a182eec9689bb.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/61e4ebd973588db51004823982d99ef5.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=1636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/87e357174f2f940c7eb03178a5061b77.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/95ec0d09b6e3561b7b0b73640b0910f7.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Heirloom</strong> is a single-player <strong>mysterious thriller adventure</strong> with puzzle elements, where players are given the opportunity to make fateful decisions while navigating through a story <strong>full of secrets and mysteries</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/f2cc6e1e814020c17c27d5e43e3a374d.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/5232b6df9ab8efdcb6c77944222272b7.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse</strong> yourself in the history of the town as you <strong>interact with the locals and any items</strong> you may find. <strong>Uncover the secrets</strong> of your family and your grandfather\u2019s old lighthouse as you work to <strong>discover the truth</strong> behind the unusual happenings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/d644ae11e43797f10112561d4a9e5168.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/dfa7b21cc76b19870adc8fb735af7f2c.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/8479583ffa11bf581f3669cc6714b42d.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not everything can be obtained easily!</strong> Solve various puzzles to <strong>learn</strong>\u00a0a little <strong>more than you should</strong>\u00a0and move on. <strong>Search for useful items</strong>, combine and <strong>use them wisely</strong>\u00a0to achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/9a78ecbacc71cbf94400bc75146a9d2b.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/bd947565a4eab061905f0aa83248c2ec.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/c6bd242eb03f1bc31ae3abf3cfe65c96.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Which path will you choose:</strong> follow the rules or go against them? Trust your heart or follow your mind? <strong>Every word</strong>\u00a0you say and <strong>every action</strong>\u00a0you take will definitely <strong>have consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/02922c8c5bf64d34eed528e6d16431fc.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>mysterious story</strong> inspired by the <strong>atmosphere of the Hebrides</strong> and <strong>Scottish folklore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting, touching, sometimes eccentric and funny <strong>dialogues</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each decision</strong> you make <strong>affects the plot</strong> and can lead to unpredictable results</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning <strong>hand-drawn graphics</strong>\u00a0and fascinating <strong>interactive cutscenes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique</strong> and <strong>exciting</strong> combinations of <strong>game mechanics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/7ed7a019f2c4b5dbcf4691623f0498e3.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MARLA MOIR</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REBECCA WANG</strong> \u2022 Guillermo\u00a0del\u00a0Toro\u2019s\u00a0<i>Tales of Arcadia</i> | <i>Jurassic\u00a0World\u00a0Camp\u00a0Cretaceous</i>\u00a0| <i>Blue\u00a0Eye\u00a0Samurai</i>\u00a0(Netflix)\u00a0| <i>Steps</i>\u00a0(Netflix)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marla is the <strong>protagonist</strong> of <i>The Heirloom</i>, a 16-year-old teenage girl and <strong>the eldest daughter of the Moir family</strong>. She is <strong>sarcastic, stubborn, and determined</strong>. Her favorite pastime is <strong>writing little horror stories</strong> in her notebook, which she uses to scare her younger brother, <strong>Jack</strong>, when he <strong>greatly annoys her</strong>. Despite her sometimes seemingly selfish and harmful behavior, is it truly so?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/5c5735d7581974e0f3b6db2fc9f80fc5.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=386 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>JACK MOIR</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REBECCA WANG</strong> \u2022 Guillermo\u00a0del\u00a0Toro\u2019s\u00a0<i>Tales of Arcadia</i> | <i>Jurassic\u00a0World\u00a0Camp\u00a0Cretaceous</i>\u00a0| <i>Blue\u00a0Eye\u00a0Samurai</i>\u00a0(Netflix)\u00a0| <i>Steps</i>\u00a0(Netflix)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack is a <strong>loyal companion</strong> and an <strong>expert in every field</strong>, as well as <strong>Marla\u2019s</strong> 10-year-old <strong>younger brother</strong>. He is still very young but highly inquisitive and intelligent, which makes him doubly a <strong>thorn in Marla\u2019s side</strong>. Whether it's rocks, plants, or all sorts of insects, Jack is right there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/ede206ac8544aa8d4a507bc84519b7b5.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=279 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MORVIN MOIR</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANDY MACK</strong>\u00a0\u2022 <i>Evil\u00a0West</i>\u00a0| <i>Dying\u00a0Light\u00a02</i>\u00a0| <i>Foolish\u00a0Mortals</i>\u00a0| <i>Postal\u00a04</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morvin is the <strong>sole living relative</strong> who agreed to take custody of his two orphaned grandchildren. He is a <strong>reclusive, grumpy</strong>, and <strong>rather peculiar old man</strong> who <strong>conceals something terrifying</strong> within the walls of his house. It appears that the only things to which he is even remotely loyal are <strong>chocolate chip biscuits</strong> and <strong>scary black birds</strong> with red eyes, which seem to be exceedingly unfriendly to everyone except him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/98da6a22641d535c75da57aab05feda7.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=386 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/8da91911cdd1655a632a182eec9689bb.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/61e4ebd973588db51004823982d99ef5.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=1636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/87e357174f2f940c7eb03178a5061b77.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/95ec0d09b6e3561b7b0b73640b0910f7.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Heirloom</strong> is a single-player <strong>mysterious thriller adventure</strong> with puzzle elements, where players are given the opportunity to make fateful decisions while navigating through a story <strong>full of secrets and mysteries</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/f2cc6e1e814020c17c27d5e43e3a374d.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/5232b6df9ab8efdcb6c77944222272b7.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse</strong> yourself in the history of the town as you <strong>interact with the locals and any items</strong> you may find. <strong>Uncover the secrets</strong> of your family and your grandfather\u2019s old lighthouse as you work to <strong>discover the truth</strong> behind the unusual happenings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/d644ae11e43797f10112561d4a9e5168.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/dfa7b21cc76b19870adc8fb735af7f2c.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/8479583ffa11bf581f3669cc6714b42d.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not everything can be obtained easily!</strong> Solve various puzzles to <strong>learn</strong>\u00a0a little <strong>more than you should</strong>\u00a0and move on. <strong>Search for useful items</strong>, combine and <strong>use them wisely</strong>\u00a0to achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/9a78ecbacc71cbf94400bc75146a9d2b.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/bd947565a4eab061905f0aa83248c2ec.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/c6bd242eb03f1bc31ae3abf3cfe65c96.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class