>, a 16-year-old teenage girl and <strong>the eldest daughter of the Moir family</strong>. She is <strong>sarcastic, stubborn, and determined</strong>. Her favorite pastime is <strong>writing little horror stories</strong> in her notebook, which she uses to scare her younger brother, <strong>Jack</strong>, when he <strong>greatly annoys her</strong>. Despite her sometimes seemingly selfish and harmful behavior, is it truly so?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/5c5735d7581974e0f3b6db2fc9f80fc5.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=386 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>JACK MOIR</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REBECCA WANG</strong> \u2022 Guillermo\u00a0del\u00a0Toro\u2019s\u00a0<i>Tales of Arcadia</i> | <i>Jurassic\u00a0World\u00a0Camp\u00a0Cretaceous</i>\u00a0| <i>Blue\u00a0Eye\u00a0Samurai</i>\u00a0(Netflix)\u00a0| <i>Steps</i>\u00a0(Netflix)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack is a <strong>loyal companion</strong> and an <strong>expert in every field</strong>, as well as <strong>Marla\u2019s</strong> 10-year-old <strong>younger brother</strong>. He is still very young but highly inquisitive and intelligent, which makes him doubly a <strong>thorn in Marla\u2019s side</strong>. Whether it's rocks, plants, or all sorts of insects, Jack is right there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/ede206ac8544aa8d4a507bc84519b7b5.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=279 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MORVIN MOIR</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANDY MACK</strong>\u00a0\u2022 <i>Evil\u00a0West</i>\u00a0| <i>Dying\u00a0Light\u00a02</i>\u00a0| <i>Foolish\u00a0Mortals</i>\u00a0| <i>Postal\u00a04</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morvin is the <strong>sole living relative</strong> who agreed to take custody of his two orphaned grandchildren. He is a <strong>reclusive, grumpy</strong>, and <strong>rather peculiar old man</strong> who <strong>conceals something terrifying</strong> within the walls of his house. It appears that the only things to which he is even remotely loyal are <strong>chocolate chip biscuits</strong> and <strong>scary black birds</strong> with red eyes, which seem to be exceedingly unfriendly to everyone except him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567320/extras/98da6a22641d535c75da57aab05feda7.avif?t=1752048963\" width=616 height=386 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Uncover the secrets of your family and your grandfather's old lighthouse as you seek the truth behind the unusual happenings in The Heirloom, a mysterious thriller adventure inspired by the atmosphere of the Hebrides and Scottish folklore!",
